lavender-0992: touch driver for Redmi Note 7 (Novatek NT36672A on BLSP1 QUP1 I2C)

Replaces the topaz FT5452/GT9896 GENI driver: polled QUP v1-tag FIFO I2C at
0x0c175000 (GPIO 2/3), GCC BLSP1 clocks, NT36672A event buffer (page 0x21c00).
Synaptics TCM (0x20) is only detected. Touch now starts without sweethw=1.

