+ * function 3), IRQ GPIO 67, reset GPIO 66 (left alone: the touch part of the
+ * TDDI is brought up with the panel by ABL). Clocks: GCC_BLSP1_AHB (vote
+ * 0x52004 bit 17), BLSP1_QUP1_I2C_APPS (RCG 0x19020, CBCR 0x19008), XO 19.2 MHz.
+ * Polled QUP v1-tag FIFO transfers (Linux i2c-qup.c), 400 kHz.
+ * The only writes to the touch IC set its register page pointer.
+ * Boot-args: sweettouch=0 off, sweettouchdelay=N s, sweettouchdiag=1 panic
